{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Game Documentation
{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
	<h1>Game Documentation</h1>
	<p>Here is the documentation for how to play the game.</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Objective:</strong>
			The goal of the game is to score higher than the dealer without exceeding 21 points.</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Gameplay:</strong>
			Players and the dealer are each dealt two cards. The player can draw more cards, and the dealer will play after the player.</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Card Values:</strong>
			Cards 2-10 are worth their face value. Face cards (J, Q, K) are worth 10. Aces are worth 1 or 11, depending on what is more favorable for the hand.</li>
	</ul>
	<a href="{{ path('game_home') }}">Back to Home</a>
{% endblock %}
